OL,3,GNEWSAWarning as scammers use real
OL,4,Apolice phone number
OL,5,
OL,6,FScammers are impersonating police
OL,7,Fofficers to try to persuade their
OL,8,Fpotential victims to pay them money
OL,9,Fover the phone, a force has warned.
OL,11,FMerseyside Police has urged the public
OL,12,Fto be vigilant after scammers also used
OL,13,Fa technique called ID spoofing to make
OL,14,Fit look like they were calling from the
OL,15,Fforce's switchboard.
OL,17,FThe warning has been issued after
OL,18,Fpeople on Merseyside reported they had
OL,19,Freceived calls from the force's genuine
OL,20,Fnumber 0151 709 6010.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
