OL,3,GNEWSAWarning as scammers use real
OL,4,Apolice phone number
OL,5,
OL,6,FMerseyside Police, which said an
OL,7,Finvestigation was under way to find the
OL,8,Fscammers, stressed that no officer
OL,9,Fshould ever ask someone for their PIN
OL,10,For bank account details.
